    <span class="eyebrow">Engineering case study &middot; Voice infrastructure</span>
    <h1>Multilingual<br>Contact Centre</h1>
    <p class="lede">Building a multilingual, browser-based call centre on Twilio Programmable Voice — and then making it survive the parts of telephony that nobody controls: carrier rejections, out-of-order webhooks, and agents whose state lives in two places at once.</p>

